{"abstract":"Accurate career path prediction can support many stakeholders, like job seekers, recruiters, HR, and project managers. However, publicly available data and tools for career path prediction are scarce. In this work, we introduce Karrierewege, a comprehensive, publicly available dataset containing over 500k career paths, significantly surpassing the size of previously available datasets. We link the dataset to the ESCO taxonomy to offer a valuable resource for predicting career trajectories. To tackle the problem of free-text inputs typically found in resumes, we enhance it by synthesizing job titles and descriptions resulting in Karrierewege+. This allows for accurate predictions from unstructured data, closely aligning with practical application challenges. We benchmark existing state-of-the-art (SOTA) models on our dataset and a previous benchmark and see increased performance and robustness by synthesizing the data for the free-text use cases.","author_count":12,"contributors":["Senger, Elena","Campbell, Yuri","van der Goot, Rob","Plank, Barbara"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-828138"],"filters":{"added":"2025-10","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"11-50 contributors","cluster_size":1,"continent":["Europe, EU","OECD"],"country":["Germany"],"glorg":["All Global Affiliations","Fraunhofer Center for International Management and Knowledge Economics (IMW)","MaiNLP research lab"],"keyword":["Career path prediction","ESCO Taxonomy"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-ITU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-ITU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"karrierewege a large scale career path prediction dataset","src":["itu"],"src-code":["DI-U-ITU"],"type":"dcp","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY","type":"rem","url":"https://aclanthology.org/2025.coling-industry.46.pdf","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-828138","identifier":[{"id":"105000138631","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["itu-07ed9e70-3571-4a3b-b403-e6d7fb963e3b"],"keyword":["Career path prediction","Career trajectories dataset","ESCO taxonomy","Resume NLP","Synthetic resume data"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Local-1-1-64C5D186530F15046DEC6CAD42F33610"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY","type":"rem","url":"https://aclanthology.org/2025.coling-industry.46.pdf","version":"Published Version"},{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY","type":"rem","url":"https://aclanthology.org/2025.coling-industry.46/","version":"Published Version"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","country":"de","key":"mainlp research lab","loc":["Germany","Europe, EU","OECD"],"name":"MaiNLP research lab","used":1},{"affno":"2","country":"de","key":"fraunhofer center for international management and knowledge economics","loc":["Germany","Europe, EU","OECD"],"name":"Fraunhofer Center for International Management and Knowledge Economics (IMW)","used":1},{"affno":"3","key":"itu it university of copenhagen","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-ITU","l3nl":"IT University of Copenhagen","l3nn":"ITU IT University of Copenhagen","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"ITU IT University of Copenhagen","namevar":["IT University of Copenhagen, Data Science","IT University of Copenhagen, Data Science, NLPnorth","IT University of Copenhagen, Data, Systems, and Robotics, Pattern Recognition Revisited lab"],"nora_code":"DI-U-ITU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1 2","corresponding":null,"first":"Elena","key":"sengerpau","last":"Senger","name":"Senger, Elena","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"first":"Yuri","key":"campbellpau","last":"Campbell","name":"Campbell, Yuri","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"3","corresponding":null,"first":"Rob","key":"vandergootpau","last":"van der Goot","locid":"8e5f2a6c-c817-4a90-b48b-d9171743ad0f","name":"van der Goot, Rob","orcid":"0009-0003-1999-4156","rank":3,"rolecod